Guide to build Bochs support librarires libcpu.a libfpu.a & libdisasm.a for Cog.
There are bochsx86 and bochsx64 subdirectories in subdirectories of the building
directory at the root (and if there are not, one can create them by using the
others as examples). There-in run conf.COG or conf.COG.dbg followed by makeem.
